% SCAFFOLDING stand-in for SIMPOS's class
% `essential_window_with_superior_input_buffer`, compiled by psi/espc.py
% into the package `simpos`.  It is NOT SIMPOS: the class is lost
% (docs/simpos/subsystems/window.md §0.3, §1.6, the plain windows).
% MENDELS (IFS No.61), 2026-11-27: its directory window and the nature of
% its parts_tree_window (mendel_win.esp create_dir_window/6, win_class.esp:
% 63-74), panes inside its `base`; garnet_win.esp three more.
%
% THE NATURE LIST IS INFERENCE: no composite's list is printed (window.md
% §1.6).  From the name (essential_ a window without the extras,
% _with_superior_input_buffer that mixin) and the printed recipe of an
% ordinary text and graphics window (TM-125 p20, the measurement window,
% PRINTED: labeled_sash, as_scroll, as_output, as_graphics, as_markers,
% as_input, as_mouse_input, user_window; WINCS my_window2, window.md
% §1.5), with inferior_window for user_window (WINCS).  MENDELS gives each
% one label_flag(off), so it has a label by default (INFERENCE).  The
% frame, the text output and the markers' list are stood in
% (basic_window.esp, labeled_sash.esp, as_input.esp, as_output.esp,
% as_markers.esp); graphics and scrolling (as_graphics, as_scroll) are
% not, and a send only they would answer is refused loudly.  It has no
% method of its own.

class essential_window_with_superior_input_buffer has

nature
        labeled_sash,
        with_superior_input_buffer,
        as_scroll,
        as_output,
        as_graphics,
        as_markers,
        as_input,
        as_mouse_input,
        inferior_window;

end.
